  ('L23-114-S2-Q39', 'L23', 'official', '下列程式碼實作哪一種正則化技術？

```python
def forward(x, p, training=True):
    if training:
        mask = np.random.binomial(1, p, size=x.shape)
        return x * mask / p
    return x
